    ["STR_COMMON[724]"] = "Which skill do you want to learn?",
    ["STR_COMMON[725]"] = "Only reborn Ninja-ninja, who have spent all 2 lives as Ninja, can learn the that Skill, PoisonStar.",
    ["STR_COMMON[726]"] = "To be a good Warrior, you must know your weapon, your armor be a 2nd skin, and use your shield to ward off your enemy! Remember, fortune favors the brave, and you must keep your head, even in the darkest hours. So, what can I do for you?.",
