    ["STR_COMMON[743]"] = "Stomper: Excels in melee combat with excellent attack range and remarkable recovery ability. Stomper`s exclusive skill",
    ["STR_COMMON[744]"] = "\t\t   can freeze enemies` blood to extend their skill cooldown time and response time.",
    ["STR_COMMON[745]"] = "Chaser: Excels in ranged combat. With a unique focusing skill, Chaser is able to control the power of wind to attack",
