    ["STR_COMMON[750]"] = "Okay, I`ve changed your branch to [MeleeStomper].",
    ["STR_COMMON[751]"] = "Wielding dual weapons, the Trojans always charge fearlessly into combat and they believe courage is the secret of victory. So, what can I do for you?",
