    ["STR_COMMON[755]"] = "Born with sharp insight and swift skill, the Archers are expert in shooting arrows and wielding throwing knives to deadly purpose.",
    ["STR_COMMON[756]"] = "Excellent! You`ve learned ways of the Archer. Do you feel a different energy in your body? That`s stronger power and battle prowess!",
