    -- SugarTang [4565]
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text1]"] = "Hey, you are still too green! Keep practicing, and come back when you reach level 100.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text2]"] = "Have you ever heard of Frost Tang? Yeah, she was very famous in her time. Not only for her beauty, but also for her great skill. You know",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text3]"] = "~she is my grandma and I wish I could be as good as her. That`s the reason why I should find the Star Tower she lost.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text4]"] = "Did you find Chou`s children? No?! Come on, Chou is my grandma`s best friend, so he must know something useful!",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text5]"] = "Have you ever seen Yang Feng? He was the last head of the Yang family. Though he`s dead, he won`t give up his desire to destroy the Star Tower.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text6]"] = "~Anyway, there is still something I can`t understand about my family. I heard the Heaven Fan has the answer I want.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text7]"] = "~are still many things I cannot understand about my family. I heard that the attack talisman, the Heaven Fan, has the answers I want.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text8]"] = "Did you find Herbalist Chou? Or any of his descendants?",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text9]"] = "Why are you still here? You should take the Tang Silk to the Kunlun Wanderer. He may know something more about it. Was there anything else you needed?",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text10]"] = "Sorry, I didn`t recognize you, just now. How is your job going? I just made an important discovery about My grandma.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text11]"] = "I read the Poem Book my grandma wrote again, and I totally understand the love between Mr. Loneliness and her, now. Thanks for all you have done for us!",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text12]"] = "Have you ever heard of Frost Tang? Yeah, she was very famous in her time. Not only for her beauty, but also for her great skill. You know",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text13]"] = "~she is my grandma and I wish I could be as good as her. That`s the reason why I should find the Star Tower she lost.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text14]"] = "Oh, this is just my grandma`s Poem Book! I`ll bury this book at her grave, then she can rest in peace... Well, my friend,",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text15]"] = "~thanks for what you have done for my family. Here`s your reward. Can you guess what it is?",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text16]"] = "What book? I can`t find any books in your bag! By the way, my grandma did write a poem book before. If we can find that book, things may be easier to understand.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text17]"] = "What book? I can`t find any books in your bag! By the way, my grandma did write a poem book before. If we can find that book, things may be easier to understand.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text18]"] = "Hmm... We need to refer this Tang Silk to Kunlun Wanderer. You can probably find him around (490,618) in Desert City. By the way, the Kunlun Wanderer will go on a trip. soon. So, be quick!",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text19]"] = "Tang Silk? It looks so beautiful! There must be many secrets about this silk. Thanks for your help!",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text20]"] = "You said that Villager Chou gave you a Tang Silk. But where is it now? Don`t tell me you have sold it for money.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text21]"] = "Hmm... We need to refer this Tang Silk to Kunlun Wanderer. You can probably find him around (490,618) in Desert City. By the way, the Kunlun Wanderer will go on a trip. soon. So, be quick!",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text22]"] = "You can probably find him in the southeast of Maple Forest. Well, I await your good news!",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text23]"] = "How could you be so careless to lose that? Fortunately, I have another one. Here you are! Don`t lose it again, okay?",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text24]"] = "Your inventory is full! Why not tidy it up, first?",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text25]"] = "I don`t know much about the Heaven Fan, but I feel that must be related to the Poem Book written by my grandma and Mr. Loneliness, years ago.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text26]"] = "~You found the Star Tower, so I think it won`t be hard for you to find a book, right?",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text27]"] = "Herbalist Chou is my grandma`s best friend, but he died, years ago. Could you go find his children with this Jadeite? I`m sure the family is still",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text28]"] = "~living in the small village, in the southeast of Maple Forest.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text29]"] = "Your inventory is full! Why not tidy it up, first?",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text30]"] = "The Star Tower is a defensive talisman once possessed by my grandma. It was incredibly powerful, but she lost it and no one knows its whereabouts.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text31]"] = "~My hero, will you help me find it?",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text32]"] = "Hm... The Star Tower has been broken into three pieces. I heard it through the grapevine.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text33]"] = "~Yang Yun may know something about one of the pieces. He is on Bird Island, now.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text34]"] = "Yeah, that`s exactly what I`m looking for! My grandma`s Star Tower was known for its DeadRabbitProject defensive qualities. But it broke into",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text35]"] = "~3 pieces when a man from the Yang family broke her heart. This started the long-standing family feud between our Tang and the Yang.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text36]"] = "I don`t find any talisman in your inventory. If you really want to help me, visit Yang Yun (732,516) on Bird Island. He will definitely be able to help you.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text37]"] = "So the ghost of Yang Feng, the late head of the family, wants to destroy the talisman, rather than let someone else have it.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text38]"] = "~That`s why some weird things happened ever since...",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text39]"] = "Well, who knows? This is a crazy world. Anyway, thank you. You may keep this Star Tower as a souvenir.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text40]"] = "~That`s the least I can do to thank you for your help.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text41]"] = "The Star Tower is a defensive talisman once possessed by my grandma. It was incredibly powerful, but she lost it and no one knows its whereabouts.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text42]"] = "~My hero, will you help me find it?",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text43]"] = "Stop kidding me! I don`t see any talismans with you. Sigh... When can I retrieve the Star Tower?",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text44]"] = "Hm... The Star Tower has been broken into three pieces. I heard it through the grapevine.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text45]"] = "~Yang Yun may know something about one of the pieces. He is on Bird Island, now.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text46]"] = "The second piece is in a Hut in the north of Bird Island. It belongs to the three Ruan Brothers. If you can find Ruan Brother, you may know more.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text47]"] = "~When you get two pieces, go to Desert City. There is someone, Plum, who should know about the third piece.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text48]"] = "Plum knows where to find the third piece. You can probably find her around (472,578) in Desert City. Watch out for the bandits when you get there.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text49]"] = "Ruan Brother`s Hut is in the north of Bird Island guarded by some magical stone doors (208,216). Ye Sheng (192,212) may tell you how to break those doors.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Option1]"] = "@STR_COMMON[62]",
