    ["STR_ID_ChiMaster[7781][Text19]"] = "To~get~promoted~to~Phase~7~and~increase~your~immunity~rate~to~critical~strikes,~you~should~have~a~character~level~of~120~,~become~a~level~7~Chi~Master~and~have~been~reborn~once.~Have~you~met~all~these~requirements?",
