    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text35]"] = "I don`t know. I need some time to think about it. It just happened so suddenly that I`m totally confused now.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text36]"] = "~Thanks, you really helped me a lot. Now you can claim your rewards from Taskmaster Chang.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text37]"] = "Have I done all the things wrong? Commander Kerry really treated me well. Maybe there is no right or wrong in the world.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text38]"] = "I don`t know. I need some time to think about it. It just happened so suddenly that I`m totally confused now.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text39]"] = "~Thanks, you really helped me a lot. Now you can claim your rewards from Taskmaster Chang.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text40]"] = "Great! You`ve collected all 5 tokens! Now I will compose them into 1 token. It is called the Token. All the Bandits will respect you once them see the token.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text41]"] = "~I will dress you just like a Bandit. Then you can meet with Guide Zhang, and he can teleport you to the Bandit Chamber. But you will",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text42]"] = "~turn back after 2 minutes.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text43]"] = "Sorry, but you`ve had the token in your inventory.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text44]"] = "The token is very important. You should take good care of it.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text45]"] = "Guide Zhang (Bird Island, 636, 656) can teleport you to Commander Kerry in the Bandit Chamber.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text46]"] = "Now you look just like a bandit. You can find Guide Zhang (Bird Island, 636, 656) to teleport you to the Bandit Chamber. But the disguise will only last for 2 minutes.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text47]"] = "I will dress you just like a bandit. Then you can meet with Guide Zhang, and he can teleport you to the Bandit Chamber. But you will",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text48]"] = "~turn back after 90 seonds.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text49]"] = "You inventory is full. You`ll need to make some room, first.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text50]"] = "Great! You`ve collected all 5 tokens! Now I will compose them into 1 Golden Token. All the Bandits will respect you once them see the token.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text51]"] = "If you can kill the Senior Bandit, you will have the chance to get the Scarlet Token.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text52]"] = "I will dress you just like a bandit. Then you can meet with Guide Zhang, and he can teleport you to the Bandit Chamber. But you will",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text53]"] = "~turn back after 90 seonds.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text54]"] = "If you can kill the Senior Bandit, you will have the chance to get the Scarlet Token.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text55]"] = "The Senior Bandits (Bird Island, 570, 416) has the Scarlet Token. He is much stronger than all the former Bandits, so you`ll need to pay more attention.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text56]"] = "~You`ll have the chance to get the token by killing him.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text57]"] = "You are much stronger than I imagined. I think my revenge will succeed, soon! There is still one thing we need to find Commander Kerry.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text58]"] = "The Bandit Deliverers appear around Bird Island (431, 453). Only killing 10 of them will the Pitch Token appears.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text59]"] = "The Senior Bandits (Bird Island, 570, 416) has the Scarlet Token. He is much stronger than all the former Bandits, so you`ll need to pay more attention.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text60]"] = "~You`ll have the chance to get the token by killing him.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text61]"] = "The Bandit Deliverers appear around Bird Island (431, 453). Only killing 10 of them will the Pitch Token appears.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text62]"] = "Actually I don`t want you to fight against the Bandit Deliverers, but we have to get the Pitch Token. You`ll need to kill 10",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text63]"] = "~Bandit Deliverers on Bird Island (525,~345) to get the Pitch Token.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text64]"] = "Great! You`ve got the Black Token. Now, caccording to the information on it, the Pitch Token is held by the Bandit Deliverers.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text65]"] = "I think only 10 Bandits and 1 Bandit Courier around Bird Island (316, 567) won`t be a trouble to you!",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text66]"] = "~Kill them, and then you`ll get the Black Token.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text67]"] = "Actually I don`t want you to fight against the Bandit Deliverers, but we have to get the Pitch Token. You`ll need to kill 10",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text68]"] = "~Bandit Deliverers on Bird Island (525,~345) to get the Pitch Token.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text69]"] = "I think only 10 Bandits and 1 Bandit Courier around Bird Island (316, 567) won`t be a trouble to you!",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text70]"] = "~Kill them, and then you`ll get the Black Token.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text71]"] = "The Indigo Token shows that a Bandit Courier has the Black Token, who is hiding among 10 Bandits. If you kill all the Bandits,",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text72]"] = "~the Bandit Couriers will appear.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text73]"] = "Great! You`ve found the Indigo Token! I must check it carefully. Thanks a lot.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text74]"] = "Well, be patient! You will find the Indigo Token if you kill enough Bandits L98 (around Bird Island 455, 466).",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text75]"] = "The Indigo Token shows that a Bandit Courier has the Black Token, who is hiding among 10 Bandits. If you kill all the Bandits,",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text76]"] = "~the Bandit Couriers will appear.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text77]"] = "Well, be patient! You will find the Indigo Token if you kill enough Bandits L98 (around Bird Island 455, 466).",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text78]"] = "Good! It is the Red Token. It shows that the Indigo Token is kept by a Bandit L98 .",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text79]"] = "The Red Token is held by the Bandit Leader L97  (around Bird Island 486, 481). Only if you kill 50 Bandits L97 will He appears.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text80]"] = "~Without this token, we won`t be able to find the other tokens.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text81]"] = "The Red Token shows the Indigo Token is kept by a Bandit L98, but I don`t know which one he is exactly.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text82]"] = "~You`ll need to keep killing the Bandits L98 until you find the token.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text83]"] = "The Red Token shows the Indigo Token is kept by a Bandit L98, but I don`t know which one he is exactly.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text84]"] = "~You`ll need to keep killing the Bandits L98 until you find the token.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text85]"] = "Your are much stronger than me. I think it will be no problem for you to defeat Commander Kerry, but it`s difficult to get to him.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text86]"] = "~You must get 4 tokens from the Bandits around Bird Island, first.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text87]"] = "Great! Now let`s start from the Red Token. You`ll need to kill 50 Bandits L97 (around Bird Island 262,117) until the Bandit Leader L97 shows up.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text88]"] = "~When he has been killed, you will obtain a Red Token. Only with it, I can find out where is the next token.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text89]"] = "Great! Now let`s start from the Red Token. You`ll need to kill 50 Bandits L97 (around Bird Island 262,117) until the Bandit Leader L97 shows up.",
    ["STR_ID_Felix[4705][Text90]"] = "~When he has been killed, you will obtain a Red Token. Only with it, I can find out where is the next token.",
