    ["STR_ID_KingdomMissionEnvoy[17400][Text16]"] = "A real hero must harbor great ambition for his kingdom. In the name of Conquer, I`m calling heroes who`ve reached Level 110 of the 1st rebirth.",
    ["STR_ID_KingdomMissionEnvoy[17400][Text17]"] = "A horde of bloodthirsty devils have occupied the Deserted Village in the Realm. They built a weird array with 4 Dark Crystals,",
