    ["STR_ID_InnerPowerNpc[18786][Text798]"] = "Once you acquire the essence of Taoism, you'll be able to make a Divine",
    ["STR_ID_InnerPowerNpc[18786][Text799]"] = "Stage 1: Activate the Refined Pure Oven (Taoist Temple 80,80) with 3 Red Flowers and 3 White Flowers",
    ["STR_ID_InnerPowerNpc[18786][Text800]"] = "Hell is so close to Heavem, if you commit a sin, you could easily on your way to Hell, but ",
