    ["STR_ID_InnerPowerNpc[18786][Text941]"] = "Sure. When there are less than 8 players left in the field, the Final starts. Each round of the Final lasts for 5 minutes. Though all of the Top 8 players will receive nice prizes, the top 3 will earn special prizes! Claim your reward before the next",
