    ["STR_ID_InnerPowerNpc[18786][Text2114]"] = "Ah, you look promising. I bet `Trojan` will be a big name in a short time. Listen, you can learn class skills and",
    ["STR_ID_InnerPowerNpc[18786][Text2115]"] = "@STR_COMMON[695]",
    ["STR_ID_InnerPowerNpc[18786][Text2116]"] = "The Dragon Whirl is a Pure skill, which means that only players who`ve been a Trojan on their two past lives and their current life as well can learn it. Though you`ve been Reborn twice, You are not a Pure Trojan.",
    ["STR_ID_InnerPowerNpc[18786][Text2117]"] = "After your 2nd Rebirth, you still have to be Reincarnated and become a Pure Trojan, to be able to learn the Dragon Whirl skill.",
    ["STR_ID_InnerPowerNpc[18786][Text2118]"] = "You don'thave the combo ( Tro - Tro - Tro ) in your status.",
