    ["STR_ID_DisCityMap1[4026314][Text1]"] = "Well, now that you`ve got 5 Soul Stones, I`ll give you 2 Exp Ball(B), a Cordiality Book(B), an Exp Pill(B) and a Dis City Bless Stone(12H)(B). Then, send you to the next level. Are you ready?",
