    ["STR_ID_FlameTaoist[4452][Text5]"] = "You already have a rune.",
    ["STR_ID_FlameTaoist[4452][Text6]"] = "You? Wait a sec... Oh, yeah, no wonder you looked familir. Each player can carry this quest ONCE a week",
    ["STR_ID_FlameTaoist[4452][Text7]"] = "Ah, you seem very interested! Good. You are eligible to light up the flame! But, it`s not the right time. You see, the",
    ["STR_ID_FlameTaoist[4452][Text8]"] = "Yeah. I`ve prepare 10 Flame Stones in the Wind Plain and Guild Arena. When the time comes, I will give you a Jade Rune. You",

