    ["STR_ID_PromotionWarrior[10001][Text35]"] = "Only Warriors who`ve trained for all three lives can learn the Pure Skill, Perseverance. If you`ve been Reborn twice, but are not a Pure Warrior, you take some Oblivion Dew to the Reincarnation Seer in the Market and be",
